### Create Produce Department
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stores/1/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "departmentCode": "PRODUCE",
  "name": "Produce",
  "description": "Fresh fruits and vegetables"
}

### Create Bakery Department
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stores/1/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "departmentCode": "BAKERY",
  "name": "Bakery",
  "description": "Fresh bread, cakes and pastries"
}

### Create Dairy Department
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stores/1/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "departmentCode": "DAIRY",
  "name": "Dairy & Eggs",
  "description": "Milk, cheese, yogurt and eggs"
}

### Get Store Departments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stores/1/departments

### Get Department
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/departments/1

### Update Department
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/departments/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "departmentCode": "PRODUCE",
  "name": "Fresh Produce",
  "description": "Fresh fruits, vegetables and organic produce"
}

### Deactivate Department
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/departments/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "active": true
}

### Duplicate Department Test
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stores/1/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "departmentCode": "PRODUCE",
  "name": "Another Produce Department",
  "description": "Duplicate test"
}